sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 浏览器用户
    participant CDN as Vercel CDN
    participant FN as Serverless 函数 api/index.mjs
    participant PS as ProjectService / MediaService
    participant PR as Prisma Client
    participant PG as Neon Postgres
    participant AI as DeepSeek / Seedream / Seedance / TTS
    participant BL as Vercel Blob

    Note over U,CDN: 流程 ①　页面加载 + SPA 深链接
    U->>CDN: GET / 或 /project/xxx
    CDN->>CDN: 无匹配静态文件 -> rewrite 到 /index.html
    CDN-->>U: 返回 client/dist/index.html (CDN 缓存)
    U->>CDN: GET /assets/index-*.js, *.css
    CDN-->>U: 静态资源
    U->>FN: GET /api/projects (React 前端 fetch)
    FN->>PS: listProjects()
    PS->>PR: project.findMany()
    PR->>PG: SELECT ...
    PG-->>PR: rows
    PR-->>PS: projects
    PS-->>FN: projects
    FN-->>U: 200 JSON

    Note over U,FN: 流程 ②　文本生成（DeepSeek，最可能长耗时）
    U->>FN: POST /api/projects/:id/story
    FN->>PS: generateStage(id, "story")
    PS->>PR: project.update(status=generating_story)
    PS->>AI: DeepSeek /chat/completions (json_object)
    AI-->>PS: 结构化 JSON
    PS->>PR: project.update(storyJson, status=story_ready)
    PS-->>FN: project
    FN-->>U: 200 JSON
    Note right of FN: maxDuration=300s；超时返回 504，前端提示改用分集生成

    Note over U,BL: 流程 ③　素材队列 + 执行 + 存储（图/视频/语音）
    U->>FN: POST /api/projects/:id/assets/queue {types}
    FN->>PS: startAssetQueue(id, types) -> 写入 AiTask(queued)
    PS->>PR: aiTask.create() xN
    PS-->>FN: {queued, tasks, limits}
    FN-->>U: 202 队列清单

    loop 前端按并发限制逐个执行
        U->>FN: POST /api/projects/tasks/:taskId/run
        FN->>PS: runAssetTask(taskId)
        PS->>PR: aiTask.update(queued -> running)  (原子领取)
        PS->>AI: Seedream 生图 / TTS 合成
        AI-->>PS: 结果 URL / 音频
        PS->>BL: saveBuffer -> put("media/<path>", access=public)
        BL-->>PS: { filePath, url }
        PS->>PR: 更新 shot/character + asset.create(filePath)
        PS-->>FN: AiTask(succeeded)
        FN-->>U: 200 JSON
    end

    Note over U,BL: 流程 ④　视频生成（创建任务 + 前端轮询）
    U->>FN: POST /api/shots/:id/video
    FN->>PS: createShotVideo(id)
    PS->>BL: blobUrlFor(首帧/参考图) -> 公网直链 (await publicAssetUrl)
    BL-->>PS: https://*.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/...
    PS->>AI: Seedance /contents/generations/tasks (imageUrl=Blob 直链)
    AI-->>PS: { taskId, status }
    PS->>PR: shot.update(videoTaskId, queued) + aiTask.create()
    PS-->>FN: { taskId, status }
    FN-->>U: 200 JSON

    loop 前端每 10s 轮询
        U->>FN: GET /api/shots/:id/video/status
        FN->>PS: getShotVideoStatus(id)
        PS->>AI: Seedance 查询任务
        alt 任务成功
            AI-->>PS: video_url
            PS->>BL: saveRemote -> put 视频/尾帧
            PS->>PR: shot.update(videoPath, succeeded)
            PS-->>FN: {status:succeeded, videoUrl:"/uploads/<path>"}
        else 进行中
            PS-->>FN: {status:running, progress}
        end
        FN-->>U: 200 JSON
    end

    Note over U,FN: 流程 ⑤　素材展示（/uploads 302 -> Blob）
    U->>FN: GET /uploads/images/xxx.jpg
    FN->>BL: head("media/images/xxx.jpg")
    BL-->>FN: blob.url
    FN-->>U: 302 Location: https://*.blob.vercel-storage.com/...
    U->>BL: 直接下载素材
